      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Describe the occasion in **Brief**: who it is for, the mood, and what to leave out.\n3. Press **Run**. The chosen image is saved under `occasion/approved`, or `occasion/review` when Jev, TypeSafe's decision model, finds a flaw.\n\nFive paid requests per run. Prices are in **OpenRouter models**; each request's charge is at openrouter.ai/activity."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        460,
