      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "GPT Image 2.5 Flare, MAI-Image-2.6 Flash, and Recraft V4.1 Flash each draw one image from the brief. GPT-6 Luna then describes all three in one request, as candidate_1 to candidate_3, and names any flaw.\n\nOpen **Draw** to change a model. Four paid requests."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
